## 1. About Cal.com


* **Website**: https://cal.com
* **Category**: Scheduling Software, Appointment Scheduling, Scheduling API / Infrastructure
* **What it does**: Eliminates scheduling back-and-forth. Connect your calendars, publish booking links or event types, and let invitees self-serve a time — with double-booking prevention, reminders, payments, and native video built in.
