## 5. Competitive Positioning


*Cal.com's genuine differentiators. Choose the right tool for the job.*


### 5.1. vs. Calendly


* Self-hostable, MIT-licensed edition available (Cal.diy) vs. cloud-only.
* HIPAA with BAA, ISO 27001, SOC 2, SSO + SCIM, and RBAC for regulated and large orgs.
* API-first architecture with embeddable Atoms and an MCP server.
* Generous free tier covering full individual scheduling.
* *Trade-off*: For small, non-technical teams with no compliance or self-hosting needs, Calendly is often the simpler pick.


### 5.2. vs. Acuity / Squarespace Scheduling


* Organization-scale hierarchy, attribute-based routing, and org-wide analytics vs. SMB/solo focus.
* Standardized HIPAA BAA, SOC 2, and ISO 27001 vs. manual/optional arrangements.
* Open developer platform and self-hosting option.


### 5.3. vs. Chili Piper / HubSpot Meetings


* Not locked to a single CRM — works across your stack with an open API and app store.
* Full admin/org analytics, SSO + SCIM provisioning, and audit logs.
* Native video, payments, and workflows without CRM dependency.


